                        "entry_id": "e9dde899-900e-3681-ba15-7ad0a2a48089",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An optical device similar to an endoscope, used in various industrial settings such as checking jet engines for cracks, observing nuclear reactors for cracks, or measuring the fat layer on a meat carcass."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4cac6bee-4021-48ad-93a9-3186f0d1ff13",
                                "sense_id": "b4e74bb0-17ca-3c5a-aae0-8403f41a2741",
                                "text": "The picture shows the introscope mounted on a valve over one of the charging holes of the fast reactor."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "036cc6e7-2cf3-456b-9dec-23c6acc5752e",
                                "sense_id": "b4e74bb0-17ca-3c5a-aae0-8403f41a2741",
                                "text": "The useful life of the introscope could be limited by several factors: acquired radioactivity, failure of the lamp, and loss of transparency in the lenses caused by their darkening under gamma-radiation ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1a7891cf-e5c6-4e96-953f-b72f22a69423",
                                "sense_id": "b4e74bb0-17ca-3c5a-aae0-8403f41a2741",
                                "text": "The photograph shows the examination of the internal surface of a tube with a moving mirror, two-power magnification introscope."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "86142a21-77fb-4561-adac-1c8247bbd18b",
                                "sense_id": "b4e74bb0-17ca-3c5a-aae0-8403f41a2741",
                                "text": "The results show that, of the conductivity probe and the introscope, the latter instrument indicated a higher level of accuracy;"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "46d15984-5d0c-4b33-8c72-4801f69c3906",
                                "sense_id": "b4e74bb0-17ca-3c5a-aae0-8403f41a2741",
                                "text": "These measurement were examined for their ability to predict the corresponding carcass introscope measurements."
                            }
                        ]
